+Frontend/backend builds, architecture ownership, Design System check, foundation (25) and adoption (14) tests passed. The local Docker verification passed after restarting the existing ClamAV service when its socket became unavailable; no health gate was disabled. On one isolated fixture, six metadata-version reads took about 32–41ms total, and the authorized HTTP heartbeat returned 112 bytes in about 43–74ms. These are bounded local samples, not production capacity or load-test evidence. Changes are local; no remote Git publication or production deployment was performed.
